<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-DEFENDING CHAMPION KRAVETS FAILS TO START TRIPLE JUMP.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-DEFENDING CHAMPION KRAVETS FAILS TO START TRIPLE JUMP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Defending champion Inessa Kravets did not turn up to the qualifying rounds of the women's triple jump on the opening day of the world championships on Saturday.</p>
<p>Ukrainian Kravets, 30, is also the Olympic champion and world record holder.</p>
</text>
